WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.925
Some sunlight is reflected; the rest is absorbed and warms the surface.

2
00:00:05.751 --> 00:00:10.051
Sunlight reaches the surface. Bright surfaces reflect most of it.

3
00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:17.890
Melt the ice, and darker ocean absorbs more, so the surface warms more.

4
00:00:20.612 --> 00:00:23.912
Ice reflects most sunlight, about eighty percent.
